1
00:00:00,324 --> 00:00:02,294
(Sheldon:)For all we know,
there are hidden compartments

2
00:00:02,293 --> 00:00:05,123
(Sheldon:)lousy with Jane Fonda
workout videos.

3
00:00:05,129 --> 00:00:07,329
(Leonard:)If there was
a hidden compartment,

4
00:00:07,331 --> 00:00:10,171
(Leonard:)don't you think you'd be
stuffed in it by now?

5
00:00:11,301 --> 00:00:14,801
(Sheldon:)Are we all up to date on our
yellow fever inoculations?

6
00:00:14,806 --> 00:00:18,306
(Howard:)You don't need a yellow fever
shot to go to Mexico.

7
00:00:18,309 --> 00:00:19,779
(Sheldon:)You can never be too careful.

8
00:00:19,777 --> 00:00:23,017
(Sheldon:)I got one last year
before I went to Epcot.

9
00:00:25,916 --> 00:00:27,416
(Amy:)So, Penny,
how's married life?

10
00:00:27,418 --> 00:00:28,518
(Penny:)Oh, it's good.

11
00:00:28,519 --> 00:00:30,149
(Penny:)I just wish Leonard
would work up the courage

12
00:00:30,154 --> 00:00:32,724
(Penny:)to tell Sheldon
he's moving in here.

13
00:00:32,723 --> 00:00:34,853
(Bernadette:)You guys still aren't
living together?

14
00:00:34,859 --> 00:00:36,829
(Penny:)We are. I mean, he sleeps here.

15
00:00:36,828 --> 00:00:38,258
(Penny:)But it's only a matter of time

16
00:00:38,262 --> 00:00:39,592
(Penny:)before Sheldon has a bad dream

17
00:00:39,597 --> 00:00:40,827
(Penny:)and tries to climb into bed

18
00:00:40,832 --> 00:00:43,502
(Penny:)with the Leonard-shaped
pile of pillows.

19
00:00:44,367 --> 00:00:46,137
(Bernadette:)Speaking of Sheldon,

20
00:00:46,137 --> 00:00:47,367
(Bernadette:)how's single life treating you?

21
00:00:47,371 --> 00:00:49,171
(Amy:)Fine, I guess.

22
00:00:49,173 --> 00:00:50,743
(Amy:)I've been focusing on me.

23
00:00:50,741 --> 00:00:52,711
(Amy:)I was thinking about
changing my wardrobe.

24
00:00:52,710 --> 00:00:54,810
Yes!
Good for you!

25
00:00:55,979 --> 00:00:58,479
(Amy:)But then I decided I don't want
to go changing who I am

26
00:00:58,482 --> 00:00:59,782
(Amy:)just because of some man.

27
00:00:59,784 --> 00:01:03,024
(Penny:)Yes.
Good for you.

